---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import BleTransferPlanner from '../../../components/BleTransferPlanner.astro';
export function getStaticPaths(){return [{params:{lang:'en'}},{params:{lang:'zh'}}];}
const lang=Astro.params.lang==='zh'?'zh':'en';
const zh=lang==='zh';
const translations={en:'/en/tools/ble-throughput-calculator/',zh:'/zh/tools/ble-throughput-calculator/'};
const title=zh?'BLE 吞吐率与传输时间计算器':'BLE Throughput & Transfer Planner';
const description=zh?'专业 BLE 传输规划工具：ATT MTU、LE 1M/2M PHY、DLE、L2CAP 分片、连接事件、iOS/Android 注意事项与传输时间估算。':'Estimate BLE GATT throughput and transfer time using negotiated ATT MTU, PHY, DLE, L2CAP fragmentation and connection-event limits. Includes iOS and Android considerations.';
const schema={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'SoftwareApplication',name:title,applicationCategory:'DeveloperApplication',operatingSystem:'Web',isAccessibleForFree:true,description,url:`https://embeddednote.com/${lang}/tools/ble-throughput-calculator/`,publisher:{'@id':'https://embeddednote.com/#publisher'}};
---
<Base lang={lang} title={title} description={description} translations={translations}>
  <BleTransferPlanner lang={lang}/>
  <!-- embeddednote-p0-20261106 -->
  <article class="p0-ble-guide prose" data-pagefind-body>
    <h2>{zh ? '工程实例：24,400 字节的 BLE 传输预算' : 'Worked example: a 24,400-byte BLE transfer budget'}</h2>
    <p>{zh ? '假设每包有 2 字节应用层头，ATT MTU 为 247，则单次 Write Command 可承载 247−3−2＝242 字节文件数据。24,400 字节需要 101 次操作。若假设每 20 ms 连接事件稳定支持 4 次操作，预算为 26 个事件槽，即 0.52 秒；这不是任何设备的实测结果。' : 'Assume a two-byte application header, ATT MTU 247 and no smaller API cap. Each Write Command then carries 247−3−2 = 242 file bytes. A 24,400-byte payload needs 101 operations. At an assumed four operations per 20 ms event, it occupies 26 full event slots, or a 0.52-second scheduling budget—not a device benchmark.'}</p>
    <p>{zh ? '同样假设下，MTU 23 的单包有效文件数据只有 18 字节，所需 1,356 次操作、339 个事件槽，即 6.78 秒。实际速度可能受平台写入队列、射频条件、接收缓存和确认策略限制。' : 'At MTU 23, only 18 file bytes fit in each operation: 1,356 operations, 339 event slots and a 6.78-second modeled budget under the same assumptions. API queues, RF conditions, receiver buffers and acknowledgments may change actual elapsed time.'}</p>
    <h3>{zh ? '怎样验证模型' : 'Verify the model on target hardware'}</h3>
    <p>{zh ? '至少记录手机与固件版本、已协商 MTU、PHY、连接间隔、设备端文件校验成功时刻。手机写入回调不一定等于接收端保存完成。明确区分模型推算和实际测试。' : 'Record phone and firmware versions, negotiated MTU, PHY, interval and the receiver-side hash-verification timestamp. A phone write callback does not necessarily mean the entire file has been committed by the peripheral.'}</p>
    <p><a href={`/${lang}/articles/ble-transfer-budget-from-mtu-to-time/`}>{zh ? '阅读完整的公式、Python 脚本与测试清单' : 'Read the full calculations, Python code and measurement checklist'}</a></p>
  </article>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />
</Base>
<style>
  .p0-ble-guide{max-width:940px;margin:30px auto 55px;padding:25px 0 0;border-top:1px solid #d7d1c7}
  .p0-ble-guide h2{font-family:Georgia,'Noto Serif SC',serif}
</style>
